<h1 class="ds-page-title">Mobile Layout</h1>
<p class="ds-page-subtitle">
  Interactive prototype for refining swipe navigation, panel layout, and scroll isolation.
  Tune the knobs, swipe around, and verify the behaviour before touching the real app.
</p>

<!-- ── Knobs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section-title">Gesture knobs</h2>
  <p class="ds-section-desc">Adjust these to find the right feel, then copy values into <code>swipe-nav.js</code>.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:4px">
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Lock threshold (px) — how far before direction is decided
      <input id="knob-lock" type="range" min="4" max="40" value="20" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-lock-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">20</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Commit threshold (% of panel width)
      <input id="knob-commit" type="range" min="10" max="60" value="13" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-commit-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">13%</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Velocity threshold (px/ms) for fast flick
      <input id="knob-vel" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="100" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-vel-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">1.00</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Rubber-band resistance (0 = rigid, 1 = none)
      <input id="knob-rubber" type="range" min="0" max="90" value="0" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-rubber-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">0.00</span>
    </label>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── Phone frame ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section-title">Prototype</h2>
  <p class="ds-section-desc">
    Swipe left/right to switch between the channel list (sidebar) and the message panel.
    Bottom tab bar switches workspaces — 5 hubs are defined so the overflow algorithm kicks in.
    Long-press a channel or tab for the context menu.
  </p>

  <div style="display:flex;gap:40px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap">

    <!-- Phone frame -->
